# User reads (specs 1.4 and 1.7). Sign in with http/auth.http first; the client keeps cookies.
# Copy your immutable id from registration into userId. Listing requires users@list;
# foreign profiles/photos require users@read plus users@read_any (admin has both).
@userId = <your-user-id>
@otherUserId = <another-user-id>

### Own canonical profile: 200, exactly seven fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### The same own UUID in uppercase still counts as self (D51)
# Paste the uppercase UUID here.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/<UPPERCASE-UUID>

### Foreign profile: 403 ownership_denied without read_any; otherwise 200 or 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{otherUserId}}

### Own protected photo: 404 until uploaded in C13
# A stored photo returns image/webp, nosniff, Cache-Control: private, max-age=300.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/photo

### An allowed but absent non-UUID id: 404 for admin, 403 without read_any
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/valid-but-absent

### Malformed id: 400 after the session and base-permission checks (D51)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/invalid.id

### First page: at most 20, newest first; no totalCount
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users

### Small page; save the cursor to continue with the same query
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?limit=2&sort=createdAt&order=desc

> {% client.global.set("usersCursor", response.body.nextCursor || ""); %}

### Next page: original snapshot and expiry are retained
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?limit=2&sort=createdAt&order=desc&cursor={{usersCursor}}

### Exact id search
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?searchBy=id&q={{userId}}

### Normalized email prefix plus status filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?searchBy=email&q=someone&status=active&sort=id&order=asc

### Literal name prefix (percent and underscore are not SQL wildcards)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?searchBy=displayName&q=Eva_%25

### Changed parameters on a cursor: 400 invalid_cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?limit=3&sort=createdAt&order=desc&cursor={{usersCursor}}

### Unknown and repeated parameters: 400 (after users@list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?limit=1&limit=2

### Corrupt cursor: 400 invalid_cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?cursor=invalid.cursor
